{"servicesList":[{"slug":"earthquake-resistant-structure","name":"Earthquake Resistant Structure","image":"/images/prefab-house.jpg","summary":"Panel and frame systems engineered and tested to withstand seismic activity common in Nepal.","content":"Our earthquake resistant structures combine a galvanized steel frame with EPS/PUF sandwich panels that are screwed directly into the frame, distributing seismic load evenly across the structure. This system has been used in schools, homes and commercial buildings rebuilt after the 2015 earthquake, and is designed to national building code standards for seismic zones."},{"slug":"eps-sandwich-panel","name":"EPS Sandwich Panel in Nepal","image":"/images/sandwich-panel.jpg","summary":"Expandable Polystyrene core panels for walls and roofs with excellent insulation and light weight.","content":"EPS Sandwich Panels consist of a lightweight expanded polystyrene core bonded between two layers of galvanized steel or cement board. They are used extensively for partition walls, cold storage, poultry farms and residential construction, offering a density of just 124 kg/m3 while retaining strong thermal and sound insulation."},{"slug":"korean-design-house","name":"Korean Design House in Nepal","image":"/images/korean-house.jpg","summary":"Modular homes based on proven Korean prefabricated housing design and technology.","content":"In partnership with Korean design technology, we bring modular home designs that can be manufactured off-site and assembled in Nepal within weeks. These homes are known for clean lines, efficient space usage, high insulation performance and resistance to extreme weather."},{"slug":"prefab-house","name":"Prefab House in Nepal","image":"/uploads/slides/1788705675548-photo-1570129477492-45c003edd2be.avif","summary":"Fully prefabricated houses assembled on site in a fraction of the time of conventional construction.","content":"Our prefab houses are manufactured in our factory and transported as ready panels and steel frames, then assembled on site — cutting construction time by more than half compared to brick-and-mortar construction, while maintaining strength, insulation and earthquake resistance."},{"slug":"sandwich-puf-panel","name":"Sandwich PUF Panel in Nepal","image":"/uploads/slides/1788705701616-images__4_.jpg","summary":"Polyurethane foam core panels offering superior insulation for cold storage and industrial use.","content":"PUF (Polyurethane Foam) Sandwich Panels provide a higher insulation value than EPS, making them ideal for cold storage rooms, food processing units and industrial facilities that require strict temperature control."},{"slug":"wall-roof-solutions","name":"Wall & Roof Solutions","image":"/uploads/slides/1788705567899-138000974030903._Lucias_Garden_photo_300dpi_w1728.avif","summary":"Complete wall and roofing systems for residential, commercial and industrial buildings.","content":"We supply and install complete wall and roof panel systems, including insulated roofing sheets, wall cladding and structural accessories, tailored to residential, commercial and industrial projects across Nepal."}]}